{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32891","headline":"酬刘谷立春日吏隐亭见寄 · 李郢","name":"酬刘谷立春日吏隐亭见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤亭遥带寺，静者独登临。\n楚霁江流慢，春归泽气阴。\n野田青牧马，幽竹暖鸣禽。\n日日年光尽，何堪故国心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32891.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32891","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}